tural and aerospace and defense applications; light commercial vehicles comprising vans and trucks; and light passenger vehicles, including passenger cars, mini-vans, cross-overs and sport-utility vehicles. PHINIA Inc. was incorporated in 2023 and is based in Auburn Hills, Michigan."}}